  "Dérive F = 0 le long de la fonction implicite : F_x + F_{v}·g′ = 0, donc g′ = −F_x/F_{v}{val}. Le signe moins vient de ce passage de l'autre côté.": "Differentiate F = 0 along the implicit function: F_x + F_{v}·g′ = 0, so g′ = −F_x/F_{v}{val}. The minus sign comes from moving the term to the other side.",
  "Fraction −F_x/F_y inversée": "Fraction −F_x/F_y upside down",
