  "Le plan tangent :": "The tangent plane:",
  "Développer et simplifier": "Expand and simplify",
  "Le plan doit passer par (a, b, f(a, b)) : en x = a, y = b, il faut z = f(a, b).": "The plane must go through (a, b, f(a, b)): at x = a, y = b, you need z = f(a, b).",
  "Le plan doit passer par (a, b, f(a, b)) : il manque f(a, b).": "The plane must go through (a, b, f(a, b)): f(a, b) is missing.",
