  "Points stationnaires de f(x, y) = {f}. On a ∂f/∂x = {fx} et ∂f/∂y = {fy}. Factorise ∂f/∂x :": "Stationary points of f(x, y) = {f}. We have ∂f/∂x = {fx} and ∂f/∂y = {fy}. Factor ∂f/∂x:",
